    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/1da25f53875cff48783af9a06d8fdda3.avif?t=1750771415\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ef776072d57ee393d373938da887ba59.avif?t=1750771415\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Exo Helljumper: Descent X</i>, immerse yourself in unmatched freedom of item customization! The demo offers over 50 prosthetics, each with unique functionalities, promising new battle strategies and surprises. Fancy bullets that split and detonate? Or homing missiles that penetrate foes? These combos ensure every fight is an electrifying enigma! Continuously experiment and discover your ideal combat style, transforming each challenge into a supercharged 1+1&gt;2 experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ca13fb529011cb6bd9b9066fd30b10b6.poster.avif?t=1750771415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ca13fb529011cb6bd9b9066fd30b10b6.webm?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ca13fb529011cb6bd9b9066fd30b10b6.mp4?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/07804196f7e6930d5f8ad324f753e019.avif?t=1750771415\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Descent X</i> fuses retro pixel art with futuristic technology, creating a vibrant world full of surprises at every turn! Awakened in a space station refuge, you face bizarre enemies and unknown dangers. As you progress, uncover the secrets hidden behind each door, drawing you closer to the truth. Here, choosing the right path and engaging each foe can yield unexpected powerful items. Each battle offers an unprecedented blend of thrill and challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/006142025b781db4313c79b496c64020.poster.avif?t=1750771415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/006142025b781db4313c79b496c64020.webm?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/006142025b781db4313c79b496c64020.mp4?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/176f9e27d09de2b8e3e2bfaa9d0e7bf0.avif?t=1750771415\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reflexes and tactical acumen will be pushed to the limit! From mutated humans and rogue machines to eerie creatures and slimy slimes, each enemy has its own unique attack patterns and behaviors. Their randomly equipped prosthetics add a layer of unpredictability to every encounter! Boss battles are ingeniously challenging, with formidable attacks and unique combat mechanics. Sharpen your observational skills, adapt to enemy behaviors, and deploy your tactics to overcome hurdles, proving you are the ultimate warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/c2ba94510ae458941504d8bed54b266a.poster.avif?t=1750771415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/c2ba94510ae458941504d8bed54b266a.webm?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/c2ba94510ae458941504d8bed54b266a.mp4?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, break through all obstacles, embrace the challenge, and deliver the most satisfying blow!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ef776072d57ee393d373938da887ba59.avif?t=1750771415\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Exo Helljumper: Descent X</i>, immerse yourself in unmatched freedom of item customization! The demo offers over 50 prosthetics, each with unique functionalities, promising new battle strategies and surprises. Fancy bullets that split and detonate? Or homing missiles that penetrate foes? These combos ensure every fight is an electrifying enigma! Continuously experiment and discover your ideal combat style, transforming each challenge into a supercharged 1+1&gt;2 experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ca13fb529011cb6bd9b9066fd30b10b6.poster.avif?t=1750771415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ca13fb529011cb6bd9b9066fd30b10b6.webm?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/ca13fb529011cb6bd9b9066fd30b10b6.mp4?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/07804196f7e6930d5f8ad324f753e019.avif?t=1750771415\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Descent X</i> fuses retro pixel art with futuristic technology, creating a vibrant world full of surprises at every turn! Awakened in a space station refuge, you face bizarre enemies and unknown dangers. As you progress, uncover the secrets hidden behind each door, drawing you closer to the truth. Here, choosing the right path and engaging each foe can yield unexpected powerful items. Each battle offers an unprecedented blend of thrill and challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/006142025b781db4313c79b496c64020.poster.avif?t=1750771415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/006142025b781db4313c79b496c64020.webm?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/006142025b781db4313c79b496c64020.mp4?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/176f9e27d09de2b8e3e2bfaa9d0e7bf0.avif?t=1750771415\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reflexes and tactical acumen will be pushed to the limit! From mutated humans and rogue machines to eerie creatures and slimy slimes, each enemy has its own unique attack patterns and behaviors. Their randomly equipped prosthetics add a layer of unpredictability to every encounter! Boss battles are ingeniously challenging, with formidable attacks and unique combat mechanics. Sharpen your observational skills, adapt to enemy behaviors, and deploy your tactics to overcome hurdles, proving you are the ultimate warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/c2ba94510ae458941504d8bed54b266a.poster.avif?t=1750771415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/c2ba94510ae458941504d8bed54b266a.webm?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282130/extras/c2ba94510ae458941504d8bed54b266a.mp4?t=1750771415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, break through all obstacles, embrace the challenge, and deliver the most satisfying blow!</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the chaotic world of Exo Helljumper: Descent X, filled with mutated foes and lurking dangers. Combine items and strategy to conquer relentless levels. Face unique foes and formidable bosses, test your cunning and skills, and feel the thrill of battle as you push beyond your limits!",
